BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wyxr-event-8214735d-ab8a-498a-a20f-b858ff8bd0c1@concert-calendar.wyxr.o
 rg
DTSTAMP:20261007T113656Z
DTSTART:20261008T000000Z
DTEND:20261008T030000Z
SUMMARY:Dave Schools w/Colin Butler — Memphis Listening Lab
LOCATION:Memphis Listening Lab\, Memphis\, TN
DESCRIPTION:Show 7 PM\nBefore joining Widespread Panic onstage at MEMPHO Fe
 st\, bassist Dave Schools is making time for an intimate hang with Memphis
  fans at Memphis Listening Lab.\n\nJoin Schools on Wednesday\, Oct. 7\, as
  he steps behind the turntables to spin records\, talk music\, and spend a
 n evening with fellow music lovers. He’ll be joined by Memphis musician 
 and DJ Colin Butler of Big Ass Truck and WYXR’s “Courtesy Flush Sound 
 System” for this special one-hour session presented by WYXR and Memphis 
 Listening Lab.\n\nThe event begins at 7 p.m.\, with doors opening at 6:30 
 p.m. Admission is free with RSVP\, but space is limited.\n\nIt will be bro
 adcast live on WYXR.org and 91.7 FM in Memphis.\nhttps://concert-calendar.
 wyxr.org/e/8214735d-ab8a-498a-a20f-b858ff8bd0c1
URL:https://concert-calendar.wyxr.org/e/8214735d-ab8a-498a-a20f-b858ff8bd0c
 1
CATEGORIES:WYXR Presents,WYXR Pick
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T113722Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
