BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wyxr-event-ffc72414-de0f-4798-82db-f980388682b0@concert-calendar.wyxr.o
 rg
DTSTAMP:20261007T113656Z
DTSTART:20261011T003000Z
DTEND:20261011T033000Z
SUMMARY:The Cramps "Greatest Gravy" Listen Up Session w/Henry Rollins (SOLD
  OUT) — Memphis Listening Lab
LOCATION:Memphis Listening Lab\, Memphis\, TN
DESCRIPTION:Show 6:00-7:30pm\n1977 Alex Chilton convinced The Cramps to com
 e to Memphis and record at Ardent.\n\nThose sessions gave us their first t
 wo singles\, but there was a lot more on the tapes. Now\, almost 50 years 
 later\, Gravest Gravy finally brings those recordings out.\n\nHenry Rollin
 s was directly involved in going through the surviving mixes and choosing 
 the versions that made the record\, and on October 10 he’s coming to MLL
  to play it for us and talk about how it all happened.\n\nHenry is also br
 inging a test pressing with alternate mixes from Songs the Lord Taught Us.
  He suggested a little homework before the event: give the regular version
  of the record a listen. It’s about 35 minutes and you’ll be able to h
 ear what’s different when he plays the alternate mixes. Not required\, o
 bviously\, but we like the idea.\n\nThe Cramps. Ardent. Alex Chilton. A re
 cord almost 50 years in the making\, coming back to Memphis.\n\nWe’re pr
 etty excited about this.\n\nThis event is part of MLL's Listen Up series a
 nd is free\, but seating is extremely limited and an RSVP is required. CUR
 RENTLY SOLD OUT!\nhttps://concert-calendar.wyxr.org/e/ffc72414-de0f-4798-8
 2db-f980388682b0
URL:https://concert-calendar.wyxr.org/e/ffc72414-de0f-4798-82db-f980388682b
 0
CATEGORIES:WYXR Presents,WYXR Pick
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T113722Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
