 rg
DTSTAMP:20261007T113656Z
DTSTART:20261205T010000Z
DTEND:20261205T040000Z
SUMMARY:WYXR's Raised By Sound Fest - Soccer Mommy w/Late Night Cardigan 
 — Satellite Music Hall
LOCATION:Satellite Music Hall\, Memphis\, TN
DESCRIPTION:Show 7 PM\nSoccer Mommy\nDubbed by Rolling Stone as “one of I
 ndie Rock’s most beloved singer-songwriters\,” Swiss-born and Nashvill
 e-based Soccer Mommy (Sophie Allison) has built a loyal following with her
  plaintive\, confessional storytelling suffused with indie pop/rock sensib
 ilities. WYXR is elated to have her headline the first Friday night Raised
  By Sound Fest show.\n\nLate Night Cardigan\nFor those who love biting lyr
 ics and soaring power-pop anthems\, Late Night Cardigan is Memphis’ wors
 t kept secret. WYXR has been a fan for years\, and you will be too. Look f
 or a new album this fall “One Million Dollars” then catch them on the 
 big stage at the brand new Satellite Music Hall in support of Soccer Mommy
  and WYXR.\n\nWYXR’s Raised By Sound Fest celebrates Memphis music\, new
  and old\, across multiple genres and features our unique group of volunte
 er DJs. It will feature free\, day-long performances on Saturday\, a ticke
 ted headline concert on Friday\, and a ticketed headline concert and after
 -party on Saturday night.\nTickets: https://raisedbysoundfest.com\nhttps:/
 /concert-calendar.wyxr.org/e/b76c4dae-74dc-4495-8a04-9b6fbbe1d9d8
URL:https://raisedbysoundfest.com
CATEGORIES:WYXR Presents,WYXR Pick
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T113722Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
